1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,962
Hello everyone!

2
00:00:01,912 --> 00:00:10,650
Today we're introducing PNCC Care, a family safety app built specifically for seniors living alone and the family members who care for them.

3
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:17,237
When older parents live by themselves, adult children naturally worry about falls or sudden emergencies.

4
00:00:17,237 --> 00:00:22,412
But installing cameras all over the house feels intrusive and strips away their privacy.

5
00:00:22,412 --> 00:00:31,750
PNCC Care takes a respectful approach: with just one simple tap on a phone or smartwatch each day, parents let their family know they're safe and well.

6
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:40,787
It works across iPhones, iPads, Apple Watches, and Android devices—simple, straightforward, and ready to use right out of the box.

